            "home": "475ceb005965f69045cf7cc7ed6a120f"
          },
          "description": {
            "fun": "In Galar the Shellder bites Slowbro's arm instead of its tail, and its poison reacts with the Galarica spice in Slowbro's body. Slowbro fires poison from the Shellder by grabbing its tongue, and it's considered highly dangerous because it sometimes attacks everything around it.",
            "sources": [
              {
                "title": "Bulbapedia: Slowbro (Pokémon)",
