        "ko": "야도킹",
        "ja-Hrkt": "ヤドキング",
        "zh-Hans": "呆呆王",
        "zh-Hant": "呆呆王"
      },
      "description": {
        "fun": "When a Shellder bites Slowpoke on the head, its venom sets off a chemical reaction that makes Slowpoke a genius, and every yawn tops up the dose. Slowking stays calm in any situation, keeps trying to learn more, and in Alola is known as 'the sage of the sea'. If the Shellder comes off, though, it forgets everything and turns back into a Slowpoke.",
        "guide": "One of Slowpoke's two final forms, introduced in Generation 2, which evolves when Slowpoke is traded holding a King's Rock. A Shellder clamped on its head like a crown gives it great intelligence. Its Galarian form is a Poison and Psychic type.",
        "tagline": "A Slowpoke made a genius by the Shellder on its head",
        "sources": [
          {
            "title": "Bulbapedia: Slowking (Pokémon)",
            "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Slowking_(Pok%C3%A9mon)"
          }
        ]
      },
