          },
          "description": {
            "fun": "In Galar the Shellder on its head grows huge and takes charge, its intelligence skyrocketing until it controls Slowking. Dressed like a sorcerer in a dark cloak, Galarian Slowking chants mysterious spells and brews potions from its own toxins, though not even it knows what they'll do.",
            "sources": [
              {
                "title": "Bulbapedia: Slowking (Pokémon)",
                "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Slowking_(Pok%C3%A9mon)"
